ZOE | Science & Nutrition on Instagram: "One question, two experts, two very different answers. 🧠

We caught up with Dr William Li and Professor Tim Spector at @eudemoniasummit to get their advice on your top health questions.

@drwilliamli is a world-renowned physician, scientist, bestselling author, and President and Medical Director of the Angiogenesis Foundation.

@tim.spector is one of the world’s 100 most-cited scientists, Professor of Epidemiology at King’s College London, a leading microbiome expert and ZOE’s scientific co-founder.

From the most underrated foods for brain health to what to do when your energy dips, here are their top tips.

This is only part one of three, so stick around for more science-backed advice. 👀"
